# Lavos from the End of Time bucket (the Good Night ending route; ends mid-battle, before the ending): load the End of
# Time save (Crono, Robo, Lucca), examine the bucket and Gaspar's warning, the Day of Lavos in 1999 A.D. (walk, the Fight/
# Run away choice, the Lavos rising cutscene), then Lavos's outer shell with its boss imitations (Dragon Tank memory, Guardian
# with bits, Heckran, Zombor, Masa and Mune, Nizbel, Magus, Giga Gaia and others) fought with attacks, Luminaire, Elixirs and
# MegaElixirs, the shell itself, walking the inner cavern to the second chamber, and the inner Lavos with its two arms
# (Shadow Doom Blaze, Evil Emanation). Ends during that fight.
